<h3 class=3D"text-lg font-bold text-text-100 mt-1 -mb-1.5">13. Team Collabo=
ration &amp; Code Reviews</h3>
<h4 class=3D"text-base font-bold text-text-100 mt-1">=F0=9F=8C=B1 Code Revi=
ew Psychology</h4>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Cognitive Bias trong Cod=
e Reviews:</strong></p>
<ol class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-decimal space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Confirmation Bias</stro=
ng>: Reviewers look for what they expect to find</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Anchoring Bias</strong>=
: First impression heavily influences review</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Authority Bias</strong>=
: Senior developer opinions carry disproportionate weight</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Availability Heuristic<=
/strong>: Recent bugs influence current review focus</li>
</ol>
