<h2 class=3D"text-xl font-bold text-text-100 mt-1 -mb-0.5">PH=E1=BA=A6N IV:=
 ADVANCED PATTERNS &amp; FUTURE CONSIDERATIONS</h2>
<h3 class=3D"text-lg font-bold text-text-100 mt-1 -mb-1.5">15. Micro-Fronte=
nd Architecture</h3>
<h4 class=3D"text-base font-bold text-text-100 mt-1">=F0=9F=8C=B1 Micro-Fro=
ntend Evolution</h4>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Monolithic Frontend Prob=
lems:</strong></p>
<ol class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-decimal space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Single Point of Failure=
</strong>: Entire app breaks if one part fails</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Technology Lock-in</str=
ong>: Stuck v=E1=BB=9Bi one framework/version</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Team Coordination</stro=
ng>: Multiple teams working on same codebase</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Deployment Coupling</st=
rong>: Can't deploy parts independently</li>
</ol>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Micro-Frontend Benefits:=
</strong></p>
<ol class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-decimal space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Technology Diversity</s=
trong>: Different teams can use different stacks</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Independent Deployment<=
/strong>: Deploy features separately</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Team Autonomy</strong>:=
 Each team owns their domain completely</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Incremental Upgrades</s=
trong>: Upgrade parts of app independently</li>
</ol>
